- **sneaky_zekey** — first external contributor. Diagnosed and first implemented the
  `CardLayout.MinCardScale` legibility-floor fix (crowded multi-panel charts skipped
  scale-to-fit and collapsed straight to chips) plus the `min-card-scale.txt` runtime
  tunable, in `SentinelSkin.cs`. Also reported the missing `PressureState` seam on
  BuySellVolumePressureMountain, and that the bar types render Heikin-Ashi bodies whose
  colour is not brick direction — a trap the docs did not carry. Work done with Claude.
  Released for open-source use under this project with permission (2026-07-27).
